# Resting mode follows the set of live activities (PS §3.1) and ranking (PS §6.2).

scenario: activities drive the resting mode
                                    -> Idle
start media                         -> Compact top=media
start timer                         -> Split
end media                           -> Compact top=timer
end timer                           -> Idle

scenario: ranking is level, then relevance, then most recently started
start a active 0.5                  -> top=a
start b active 0.9                  -> top=b
start c active 0.9                  -> top=c     # tie: newer wins
start d timeSensitive 0.1           -> top=d
start c active 0.9                  -> top=d     # restart = update, keeps its place
end d                               -> top=c
